        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Clegg\n- Projects: Carry On franchise, Carry On films, Carry On Screaming!\n- Topics: British film and television acting\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Clegg was an English actor who lived from 1915 to 1996.\n- From the 1950s through the 1970s, Tom Clegg had a number of small roles in film and television.\n- The Carry On franchise primarily consists of 31 low-budget British comedy films released from 1958 to 1992.\n- The Carry On franchise also includes four Christmas specials, a television series of 13 episodes, and three West End and provincial stage plays.\n- Tom Clegg is known for appearing in several Carry On films, especially Carry On Screaming!.",
